\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: Technical Play Of The Day Is Dollar Index\b0\par\par\uc2 1,296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 2010\par 16:02\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in New York.  Robert Flint, 212-416-2216; \par robert.flint@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1402 GMT [Dow Jones] The index rose earlier to 83.214, which the current high for the uptrend from the Aug. 6 low of 80.085. See chart at\f28 \par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.dowjoneswebservices.com/chart/view/4462"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.dowjoneswebservices.com/chart/view/4462}}}\par \par \uc2 The index is closing in on target resistance at 83.385. But a move below 82.935 would instead point it down to 82.347.\par \par \uc2 (stephen.cox@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1353 GMT [Dow Jones] Russia is less likely to enact capital controls now, given the less stable external backdrop and negative net private capital flow, \uc2 Royal Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  says. Nevertheless, "continued \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is costly, and reduced inflows would lessen that cost." Any capital controls would probably be targeted, rather than broad based, the bank says. These may include high tax penalties for withdrawing portfolio investments early, differentiated reserve requirements for banks, caps on foreign borrowing by state-owned companies, and reducing the tax-deductibility of interest payments on foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans. (ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 1348 GMT [Dow Jones] The major theme in recent weeks is global investors gravitating to emerging market local bonds, says RBS. Month-to-date, 2-year through 10-year yields have fallen between 5 bps and 50 bps across key liquid