\par\par \b \uc2 5th UPDATE:BOC Carney:Fundamentals Can't Account For C$ Volatility   \b0\par\par\uc2 551 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Dezember 2007\par 00:23\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Updates with more quotes, more details.)   \par \par \uc2 OTTAWA (Dow Jones)--Mark Carney, the incoming governor of the  \uc2 Bank of Canada\uc2 , Wednesday said fundamental factors alone can't account for the volatility of the Canadian dollar in recent months.   \par \par \uc2 Carney, who is currently adviser to Governor David Dodge, also said he doesn't favor pegging the Canadian dollar to the U.S. unit, or a monetary union. He said the  \uc2 Bank of Canada\uc2  must focus on inflation targeting in conducting monetary policy.   \par \par \uc2 He made the remarks in an unprecedented appearance before the House of Commons finance committee. It's the first time a governor designate has testified before the committee prior to formally assuming the post.   \par \par \uc2 "Certainly we have seen substantial volatility in exchange rate markets recently, including the Canadian dollar," Carney said. "Certainly the volatility that we have seen in the Canadian dollar cannot be accounted for purely by changes in fundamentals."   \par \par \uc2 He said the best contribution the Bank can make in dealing with the volatility is to focus on its "principal and sole" objective of achieving low, stable and predictable inflation, and it was important to communicate this point.   \par \par \uc2 "The way to inject more volatility is to be perceived to change between targets. And I would submit that what we need to do at the Bank is retain the focus on the inflation target..." he said.   \par \par \uc2 He said people tend to forget the costs of inflation. He pointed out that Canada has had 15 years of low and stable inflation, coinciding with the Bank's adoption of inflation targeting.   \par \par \uc2 "That's what we risk putting in peril if we take our eye off the ball. I want to assure you I will not take my eye off the ball," he said.   \par \par \uc2 Carney said inflationary booms always end badly and it requires "Herculean effort" to get it back on track.   \par \par \uc2 Carney said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to control the level of the Canadian dollar since 1998. The Bank only does so under exceptional circumstances. He said any decision to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  is made jointly with \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's department of finance.   \par \par \uc2 Carney said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's quarter-point rate cut Tuesday, the first since April 2004, has made the yield curve less steep. He said the yield curve from the overnight to three-month rate is unusually steep.   \par \par \uc2 "The change in the overnight rate yesterday has a resulted in a lowering of that curve. So while the curve is still steep, at least it's moving with the overnight rate," he said.   \par \par \uc2 He said the Bank is trying to ensure that issues in the financial system don't spill over into the broad economy. He said market participants must bear the consequences of their decisions, but he said that securitization must continue.   \par \par \uc2 "Securitizaton's under real pressure, rightly so because some products have become too complex. But it should trim down to a core of more standardized products which can really enhance the efficiency of markets," he said.   \par \par \uc2 Carney becomes governor Feb. 1 after Dodge retires Jan. 31. He told the committee that he applied for the position.   \par \par \uc2 -Nirmala Menon, Dow Jones Newswires; 613-237-0668; nirmala.menon@dowjones.com [ 12-05-07 1823ET ]   \par \par \uc2 4346   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020071205e3c5000qa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
