\par\par \b \uc2  Canada dollar ends firmer,  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  talk dominates. \b0\par\par\uc2 713 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2001\par 00:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      Bank of Canada: CANADA OPEN  1.5729  PREVIOUS CLOSE 1.5679 \par \par \uc2  ------------------------------------------------------------ \par \par \uc2      By Amran Abocar \par \par \uc2      TORONTO, March 28 (Reuters) - The Canadian dollar closed \par \par \uc2  slightly stronger against the U.S. dollar on Wednesday in a \par \par \uc2  market dominated by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  statements. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  adopted a defensive stance ahead of a speech \par \par \uc2  by Bank of Canada Governor David Dodge to a Senate banking \par \par \uc2  committee on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2      In comments made after the markets closed, Dodge said the \par \par \uc2  falling Canadian dollar may leave less room for interest-rate \par \par \uc2  cuts. \par \par \uc2      That prompted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken slightly to C$1.5650 \par \par \uc2  from C$1.5636 on initial disappointment from players who may \par \par \uc2  have been bullish on more rate cuts, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      Dodge also said Canada's economic fundamentals are the best \par \par \uc2  they have been in nearly three decades and that should work in \par \par \uc2  favor of the Canadian dollar over time. \par \par \uc2      Talk of a possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the flagging \par \par \uc2  dollar - hovering at 2-1/2 year lows and edging ever closer to \par \par \uc2  its record low of C$1.5850 - had rippled through the market \par \par \uc2  earlier, following comments by deputy Bank Governor Sheryl \par \par \uc2  Kennedy. \par \par \uc2  Kennedy said the bank is watching the weakening Canadian \par \par \uc2  dollar to gauge its impact on "total demand and inflation," \par \par \uc2  comments reiterated by Dodge in his speech. \par \par \uc2  While some market players inferred the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be \par \par \uc2  signaling an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , others noted the comments were taken \par \par \uc2  out of context and threw cold water on the chances of the bank \par \par \uc2  stepping in to prop up the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The market may have speculated that the bank was going to \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  but I think that's probably overplaying it," said \par \par \uc2  David Ebata, managing analyst of Canadian markets at Thomson \par \par \uc2  IFR. "There's absolutely no indication that the bank was going \par \par \uc2  to do anything. As a result, after the initial move down to the \par \par \uc2  lows, dollar Canada went back up again. \par \par \uc2  "I think it was more an excuse for dealers to take out \par \par \uc2  stops, another opportunity for dealers to get a little long \par \par \uc2  (US) dollars," he added. \par \par \uc2  Helene Moermen, senior advisor of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at \par \par \uc2  National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Montreal, also dismissed the \par \par \uc2  likelihood of an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , noting the bank has stated it \par \par \uc2  will only step in "if there is panic and I really don't think \par \par \uc2  the market is panicking right now." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said, at most, the comments could be signaling the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not lower interest rates aggressively at its \par \par \uc2  next meeting on April 17 or, even, make any cuts at all. \par \par \uc2  CANADIAN DOLLAR ENDS HIGHER DESPITE EQUITIES FALL \par \par \uc2  The Canadian dollar closed at C$1.5644 to the U.S. dollar, \par \par \uc2  or 63.92 U.S. cents, compared with a close of C$1.5679, or \par \par \uc2  63.78 U.S. cents, in the previous session on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which opened at C$1.5729 following a sell-off \par \par \uc2  inspired by strong U.S. consumer confidence data in the \par \par \uc2  previous session, moved in a range of C$1.5733 to C$1.5625 in \par \par \uc2  North American trading. \par \par \uc2  "This is a surprise given that the Canadian dollar has \par \par \uc2  generally been tracking North American equities markets," said \par \par \uc2  Doug Porter, senior economist at BMO Nesbitt Burns. \par \par \uc2  "And given that we had the added weight of yet another huge \par \par \uc2  pullback in Nortel, I have to say today's performance by the \par \par \uc2  Canadian dollar is a bit of a shock." \par \par \uc2  North American equities markets plunged on Wednesday after \par \par \uc2  Nortel Networks warned late on Tuesday that first-quarter \par \par \uc2  results would fall below analyst expectations and said it would \par \par \uc2  cut more jobs. \par \par \uc2  The Toronto Stock Exchange closed 244 points lower, the Dow \par \par \uc2  Jones industrial average fell 162 points, while Nasdaq dropped \par \par \uc2  118 points. \par \par \uc2  Some analysts said Tuesday's sell-off in the Canadian \par \par \uc2  dollar may have been overdone, setting the stage for some gains \par \par \uc2  on Wednesday. As well, dealers said some bargain-hunting lent \par \par \uc2  slight support to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In cross-trading on Wednesday, the Canadian dollar was at \par \par \uc2  C$1.3859 against the euro versus C$1.4000 at the \par \par \uc2  previous session's close. The Canadian dollar was at \par \par \uc2  78.08 yen, compared with 77.88 yen, and the Australian dollar \par \par \uc2  was at A$1.2934 versus A$1.2760 at the previous close. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx3s032jn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
